"On POSIX systems on which B<fdatasync>()  is available, "
"B<_POSIX_SYNCHRONIZED_IO> is defined in I<E<lt>unistd.hE<gt>> to a value "
"greater than 0.  (See also B<sysconf>(3).)"
msgstr ""

